     "up": {"title":"Which discipline prepares you for this career? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>A regional careers fair adds Computer Science jobs and some closer calls. Sort each advert by the discipline that BEST prepares a candidate for it.</p>","bins":["Computer Science","Computer Engineering","Software Engineering","Information Technology","Information Systems"],"items":[{"t":"Business analyst redesigning how a Guyana ministry processes land title applications.","bin":4,"fb":"Analysing and redesigning business processes is Information Systems."},{"t":"Developer leading the requirements, design and maintenance of an e-government portal in St. Lucia.","bin":2,"fb":"Systematic development and maintenance of large software is Software Engineering."},{"t":"Algorithm designer improving how a ride-hailing app in Port of Spain matches drivers to riders efficiently.","bin":0,"fb":"Making a matching method faster and better is Computer Science."},{"t":"Network technician installing fibre links and switches at a resort in Tobago.","bin":3,"fb":"Installing network infrastructure is Information Technology."},{"t":"Researcher developing a machine-learning model that predicts sargassum seaweed landings on Barbados beaches.","bin":0,"fb":"Creating a new predictive algorithm is Computer Science."},{"t":"Systems administrator managing servers and backups for a hospital in Kingston.","bin":3,"fb":"Running and protecting infrastructure is Information Technology."},{"t":"Chief Information Officer deciding how technology spending supports a bank's strategy in Trinidad and Tobago.","bin":4,"fb":"Aligning technology with organisational strategy is Information Systems."},{"t":"Firmware engineer for smart water meters installed across Antigua.","bin":1,"fb":"Writing firmware that controls hardware is Computer Engineering."},{"t":"Software tester and release manager for a regional mobile banking app.","bin":2,"fb":"Testing and releasing within a disciplined process is Software Engineering."},{"t":"Engineer designing the control board for a solar-powered streetlight in St. Vincent.","bin":1,"fb":"Designing a circuit board is Computer Engineering."}],"win":"Excellent. You separated creating algorithms (CS) from building software (SE), and designing hardware (CE) from installing it (IT)."}
