     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">St. Vincent's Department of Digital Services is planning a project to let residents pay electricity bills, renew licences and book appointments through one mobile app. The project team will include a computer engineer, a computer scientist, a software engineer, an IT specialist and an information systems analyst.</p>",
     "prompt": "<p>Answer all parts.</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>Explain the difference between <b>Computing</b> and <b>Computer Science</b>. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Describe the role each of the FIVE team members could play in the project, showing the main focus of each discipline. <i>(5 marks)</i></li><li>Identify TWO commonalities shared by all five disciplines. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Distinguish between Information Technology and Information Systems. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Describe how membership of TWO professional organisations could benefit members of the team. <i>(4 marks)</i></li></ol>",
     "min": 250,
