     "up": {"title":"Trust, worth or protection? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Spice Isle Credit Union in St. George's, Grenada has logged ten problems. For each one, work out the specific characteristic first (distortion, timeliness, availability and so on), then sort it into its family.</p>","main":"Which family of characteristics does this problem affect?","bins":["Trust and understanding","Usefulness and worth","Protection and access"],"items":[{"t":"A teller tells a neighbour another member's account balance.","bin":2,"fb":"Sensitive information reaches an unauthorised person: confidentiality."},{"t":"The board receives a loan-default report the morning after it approved the new loans.","bin":1,"fb":"Accurate but too late for the decision: timeliness."},{"t":"A quote from the CEO is cut short in the newsletter, so \"we will not raise fees unless costs rise\" becomes \"we will not raise fees\".","bin":0,"fb":"The meaning was changed as it was passed on: distortion, a trust problem."},{"t":"A rival credit union pays a data firm for regional borrowing trends.","bin":1,"fb":"Information is bought and sold: information as a commodity."},{"t":"Members cannot view their statements for two days after a server update fails.","bin":2,"fb":"Authorised users cannot reach their information: availability."},{"t":"Last quarter's interest rates are still on the website after rates have changed.","bin":1,"fb":"The information has passed its lifespan."},{"t":"The annual report's chart starts its axis at 90%, so a 1% fall in loan approvals looks dramatic.","bin":0,"fb":"The figures are correct, but their meaning is bent by the presentation: disguise."},{"t":"A shared drive holding scanned member IDs has no password.","bin":2,"fb":"No protective control is in place: security."},{"t":"Two managers read the same member survey: one sees demand for a mobile app, the other sees members preferring branches.","bin":0,"fb":"The same information is read in different ways: subject to interpretation."},{"t":"A loan officer's report on an applicant leaves out a second outstanding loan.","bin":1,"fb":"A key fact is missing: completeness."}],"win":"Well done. Naming the specific characteristic first, then its family, is exactly how to recall the long syllabus list quickly under exam conditions."}
