     "stimulus": "<p class=\"passage\">The St. Anna Bay Tech Supplies in Willemstad sells computers and accessories. The manager wants to train new staff about the products and keep up with new technology. She is considering four sources: printed supplier catalogues, a computing magazine subscription, the web sites and blogs of technology companies, and a subscription to an electronic database of trade journals. Staff also suggest asking customers on the shop's social media page what they need.</p>",
