     "up": {"title":"Format or medium? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>A reef-monitoring project in Bonaire shares its results in many ways. Some cards are file types or arrangements; others are carriers. Decide which each card names.</p>","main":"Arrangement or carrier?","bins":["Format (how it is arranged)","Medium (what carries it)"],"items":[{"t":"The World Wide Web, where the PDF is posted","bin":1,"fb":"The web carries the PDF to readers: medium."},{"t":"A map shading the damaged reef zones","bin":0,"fb":"A map is an arrangement of information: format."},{"t":"Face-to-face speech at a community meeting","bin":1,"fb":"Speech in person is the channel that delivers the information: medium."},{"t":"A shared cloud storage folder used by the ministry","bin":1,"fb":"The cloud folder stores and delivers the files: medium."},{"t":"A captioned video for hearing-impaired viewers","bin":0,"fb":"Captioned video is the form the information takes: format."},{"t":"A spreadsheet of hourly water temperatures","bin":0,"fb":"A spreadsheet arranges the data in rows and columns: format."},{"t":"A DVD sent to schools","bin":1,"fb":"The disc carries the content: medium."},{"t":"A PDF of the full survey report","bin":0,"fb":"PDF is a file format: a way of arranging and presenting the document."},{"t":"A slideshow summarising the findings","bin":0,"fb":"A slideshow is a way of presenting information: format."},{"t":"A mobile app that sends alerts to divers","bin":1,"fb":"The app is the carrier that delivers the alerts: medium."}],"win":"Well sorted. File types such as PDF and spreadsheet are formats; the web, cloud storage, discs, apps and speech are media. Keeping them apart earns both marks."}
