     "up": {"title":"Characteristic or criterion? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Each pair of statements is about the same report on Hurricane Irma recovery. One <b>describes</b> it; the other <b>tests</b> it against a purpose. Sort each statement.</p>","main":"Describing the source, or testing it for selection?","bins":["Characteristic (describes the source)","Criterion (test for selection)"],"items":[{"t":"It covers only the Dutch side, so it is not enough for a whole-island study.","bin":1,"fb":"Coverage judged against the purpose: the completeness criterion."},{"t":"The report was published in 2018.","bin":0,"fb":"A plain statement of currency: characteristic."},{"t":"Its damage total does not match the official statistics, so it must be verified before use.","bin":1,"fb":"A check on correctness: the accuracy criterion."},{"t":"It costs nothing to download.","bin":0,"fb":"Cost: characteristic."},{"t":"It was written by a firm bidding for rebuilding contracts, so its recommendations need balancing.","bin":1,"fb":"A judgement about whose interests shape it: the bias criterion."},{"t":"Its snow-load advice was written for Canada, so it does not apply here.","bin":1,"fb":"A judgement about setting: the cultural context criterion."},{"t":"It is a 90-page PDF on a government web site.","bin":0,"fb":"Format and medium: characteristic."},{"t":"It covers every district of Dutch Sint Maarten in detail.","bin":0,"fb":"It describes breadth and depth: characteristic."},{"t":"It was written by named engineers at the public works department.","bin":0,"fb":"A fact about authorship that informs reliability: a description."},{"t":"Published in 2018, it is too old to give current rebuilding costs, so a newer source is needed.","bin":1,"fb":"The same date, now judged against the purpose: currency as a criterion."}],"win":"Excellent. The same fact can be a characteristic or a criterion; it becomes a criterion when you judge it against a purpose and decide what to do."}
