      "prompt": "<p>(a) State the name of the characteristic that describes <i>whether, when and where</i> a user can get hold of a source. (1 mark)</p><p>(b) Using the passage, state where or when EACH source can be read. (2 marks)</p><p>(c) Complete the sentence: \"Source 1 has low currency because ..., whereas Source 2 has high currency because ...\" (2 marks)</p>",
      "min": 50,
