     "up": {"title":"Manual, automated or mixed system? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Organisations across the region process data in different ways. Analyse each system stage by stage before you decide.</p>","items":[{"text":"A nutmeg co-operative in Grenada weighs each farmer's sacks on a digital scale that sends the weight to a computer, which calculates the payment and prints a receipt.","options":["Manual","Automated","Mixed"],"answer":1,"fb":"Capture, calculation and output are all done by devices and software: automated."},{"text":"A clinic in Roseau records patients' details on paper forms; a clerk keys them into a database each evening, and the database prints the next day's appointment lists.","options":["Manual","Mixed","Automated"],"answer":1,"fb":"Collection on paper is manual; storage, processing and printed output are automated: mixed."},{"text":"A teacher scans OMR answer sheets to mark a test, but writes each student's comment by hand on the report card.","options":["Mixed","Manual","Automated"],"answer":0,"fb":"Marking is automated; the comments and report card are manual: mixed."},{"text":"A village shop owner adds up the day's sales from her notebook with a pocket calculator.","options":["Mixed","Manual","Automated"],"answer":1,"fb":"A calculator is a tool in a person's hands; she controls every step: manual."},{"text":"A tide gauge in Antigua sends sea-level readings every minute to a computer, which publishes a live graph online.","options":["Automated","Manual","Mixed"],"answer":0,"fb":"A sensor captures the data and software processes and disseminates it: automated."},{"text":"A school in Dominica keeps paper attendance registers, but the office photographs each page and saves the images to a cloud drive. How is the system BEST described?","options":["Mixed: manual input and processing, automated storage","Automated","Manual"],"answer":0,"fb":"The register and any counting are manual, but storage is digital: a mixed system."},{"text":"Which feature makes a system automated rather than mixed?","options":["Devices and software carry out every stage, with people only supervising","It uses at least one computer","It produces printed output"],"answer":0,"fb":"One computer at one stage makes a system mixed, not automated. Automated means every stage is done by devices and software."}],"win":"Well analysed. Judge each stage separately: a system is automated only when devices and software carry out every stage; most real systems are mixed."}
