     "up": {"title":"Presenting or dissemination? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>Disaster and public agencies across the region are improving their output. Some changes alter how the information <b>looks or sounds</b>; others change how it <b>reaches people</b>. Sort each change by its MAIN effect.</p>","main":"Form of the information, or distribution?","bins":["Presenting","Dissemination"],"items":[{"t":"Exam results are released on the parent portal at 9 a.m. so every parent sees them at the same time.","bin":1,"fb":"Choosing the channel and timing of release: dissemination."},{"t":"Volunteers drive through villages with loudspeakers repeating the evacuation notice.","bin":1,"fb":"Reaching people who may not have phones: dissemination."},{"t":"The ministry redesigns its storm bulletin with large, plain-language headings for elderly readers.","bin":0,"fb":"Changing layout and wording changes the form: presenting."},{"t":"Copies of the annual report are posted to every board member.","bin":1,"fb":"Distributing copies: dissemination."},{"t":"A four-page paragraph is replaced by a one-page table comparing districts.","bin":0,"fb":"Paragraph to table is a change of form: presenting."},{"t":"A dashboard highlights in red every branch that is below target.","bin":0,"fb":"Colour coding is about how the information looks: presenting."},{"t":"The weather office adds captions to its video bulletin for deaf viewers.","bin":0,"fb":"Captions change the form so more users can understand it: presenting."},{"t":"A tour company translates its safety briefing into Spanish and French.","bin":0,"fb":"Language is part of the form of the information: presenting."},{"t":"The same bulletin is sent by SMS cell broadcast to every phone in the parish.","bin":1,"fb":"Sending it to an audience through a channel: dissemination."},{"t":"An airline pushes a gate-change notice to passengers' phones.","bin":1,"fb":"Delivering the information to its audience: dissemination."}],"win":"Correct. Presenting decides how information looks or sounds (layout, colour, format, language, captions); dissemination decides how and when it reaches the audience. A full output answer covers both."}
