     "up": {"title":"Manual or automated information system? (Challenge)","bloom":"Analyse","intro":"<p>These information systems are found across the region. Many real systems are partly manual and partly automated, so there is a third box this time.</p>","main":"Manual, automated or mixed?","bins":["Manual information system","Automated information system","Mixed system"],"items":[{"t":"A teacher marks tests by hand, then enters the marks into a spreadsheet that calculates grades.","bin":2,"fb":"Manual marking and entry, automated calculation: mixed."},{"t":"Travel agents and websites worldwide book seats on the same regional flight.","bin":1,"fb":"An airline reservation system: automated."},{"t":"A bottling plant in Trinidad tracks caps and bottles and re-orders automatically.","bin":1,"fb":"Manufacturing inventory control: automated."},{"t":"A snackette writes every bill by hand and keeps the cash in a box.","bin":0,"fb":"Handwritten bills and a cash box: manual."},{"t":"A fishers' co-operative in Gouyave records each boat's catch in a ledger.","bin":0,"fb":"Records kept in a physical ledger: manual."},{"t":"A clinic in Roseau keeps paper patient folders but books appointments online.","bin":2,"fb":"Paper records plus an automated booking system: mixed."},{"t":"A cash withdrawal at an ATM in Kingston updates the account balance at once.","bin":1,"fb":"ATM transactions: automated."},{"t":"A resort pays 600 staff from a payroll database management system.","bin":1,"fb":"A payroll DBMS: automated."},{"t":"A hardware store rings up sales on a POS terminal but counts stock by hand each month in a ledger.","bin":2,"fb":"Automated sales capture, manual stock count: mixed."},{"t":"A church secretary types letters to members on a typewriter.","bin":0,"fb":"Typewriter, not a word processor: manual."}],"win":"Well sorted. Judge the whole system stage by stage: manual if people do everything, automated if devices and software do everything, and mixed when both are involved, which is the most common case."}
