      "In (b) I compared manual and automated for input, processing and output, using \"whereas\".",
      "In (c) I gave one advantage and one disadvantage with reasons.",
      "I ended with a justified recommendation.",
      "I used syllabus terms: data capture, sorting, calculating, dissemination, retrieving."
