      "prompt": "<p>Answer each part about the Sea-Almond Secondary School library.</p>\n<p>(a) (i) <b>State</b> where the catalogue cards are stored and the order they are filed in. (2 marks)</p>\n<p>(a) (ii) <b>Complete the sentence:</b> \"Finding a book by its author is quick because ..., but finding all the books on one subject is slow because ...\" (2 marks)</p>\n<p>(b) <b>State</b> how a book loan is recorded (i) in the manual system and (ii) in the automated system. (2 marks)</p>\n<p>(c) <b>Give</b> ONE advantage and ONE disadvantage of automating the library. (2 marks)</p>\n<p>(d) <b>Complete the sentence:</b> \"I recommend that the school should / should not automate the library because ...\" (1 mark)</p>",
