     "up": {"title":"Match the need to the tool (Challenge)","bloom":"Evaluate","intro":"<p>St. John's Youth Choir has nine needs. Several tools could do some of them badly; match each need to the tool that meets it BEST.</p>","pairs":[{"l":"Rehearse live with a soloist in Barbados while sharing the score on screen","r":"Web-conferencing tool"},{"l":"Reach fans worldwide with a new music video and read their comments","r":"Social media tool"},{"l":"Send the term newsletter to 250 parents, who can unsubscribe","r":"Mailing list"},{"l":"Send 4 GB of studio recordings to the producer's server","r":"FTP (upload)"},{"l":"Text a 6 a.m. rain cancellation to parents with basic phones","r":"SMS"},{"l":"Keep a searchable archive of members' questions about costumes","r":"Discussion forum"},{"l":"Call the choir's sponsor in Toronto cheaply","r":"VoIP"},{"l":"Find the official rules for a regional choir competition","r":"Search engine"},{"l":"Share voice notes of practice parts with members on different kinds of phone","r":"Cross-platform messaging tool"}],"win":"All correct. Each choice matches the type of data, the timing, the audience and any constraint, such as basic phones or very large files."}
